ce-ambition-big-boom-name = Big Boom!
ce-ambition-big-boom-desc = I'll create something that goes bang or explodes loudly (safely!).

ce-ambition-trickster-name = Tricky Trick
ce-ambition-trickster-desc = I'll prank !COUNT! people in a tricky but harmless way.

ce-ambition-goblin-trade-name = Goblin Trade
ce-ambition-goblin-trade-desc = I'll barter with !NAME! for their clothes or other external items for something less valuable.

ce-ambition-big-boss-name = Big Boss
ce-ambition-big-boss-desc = I'll convince !COUNT! other goblins to obey me today.

ce-ambition-shiny-collector-name = Shiny Things!
ce-ambition-shiny-collector-desc = I'll collect !COUNT! shiny or bright items for my collection.

ce-ambition-mushroom-farm-name = Mushroom Farm
ce-ambition-mushroom-farm-desc = I'll grow mushrooms in !LOCATION! - it's goblin business!

ce-ambition-underground-cozy-name = Underground Cozy
ce-ambition-underground-cozy-desc = I'll set up a dark shelter under !LOCATION! - it's cozy there!
